[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m \[ n = (a + b)^2. \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m Equating the two expressions for \( n \), we have:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m \[ b(a + 1) = (a + b)^2. \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m Expanding and rearranging terms, we get:
