[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m \[ a^2 - 2a = 0, \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m \[ a(a - 2) = 0. \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-0) pid=295518)[0m So, \( a = 0 \) or \( a = 2 \). Since \( a \) must be a positive digit, \( a = 2 \). Then \( n = 2^2 + 2 = 6 \), but \( \sqrt
