[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=295776)[0m \[ f_n(x) = \begin{cases} 1 - nx, & \text{if } 0 \leq x \leq \frac{1}{n}, \\ 0, & \text{otherwise}, \end{cases} \]
